# 07-mcp-servers: Diagnostiquer un serveur MCP local stdio

Output mcp-local-stdio-demo.gif

Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1000
Set Height 600
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Padding 20
Set BorderRadius 8
Set Margin 10
Set MarginFill "#282a36"
Set Framerate 10
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Type "copilot"
Enter
Sleep 5s

Type "Explain which local stdio MCP server is configured, which tools it exposes, and what files it can access."
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 20s

Type " "
Backspace
Sleep 2s
Ctrl+C
Sleep 1s
